    "body": "I put up https://github.com/whatwg/mimesniff/pull/171 which we could call here so the least amount of information leaves the network layer. Seems cleanest. That would require a slight restructuring, but nothing too bad and it would make the Resource Timing side very straightforward.\r\n\r\n@yoavweiss indicated support in https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/88#issuecomment-1525816957. Once I've had review of the MIME Sniffing PR I would be happy to update this PR as well and provide instructions for the Resource Timing PR.",
